    "profile_text": {
        "body": "WeRide Inc. describes itself as a leading, commercial-stage global company that develops autonomous driving technologies from Level 2 to Level 4. Its website says the company operates a universal autonomous driving technology platform called WeRide One, along with a self-developed foundational toolchain and what it calls an industry-leading accumulation of real-world operational data. The company says its business footprint spans more than 60 cities across 13 countries, and it offers a portfolio of five core products, including Robotaxi.\n\nWeRide is listed on Nasdaq under the ticker WRD and on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange under 0800. The company says it has been recognized in Fortune's 2025 Change the World and 2025 Future 50 lists. Public company records list WeRide Inc. as a for-profit entity headquartered in Guanzhou, with CIK 0001867729 and the alias WERIDE INC-ADR.\n\nNo litigation entries or MCP servers are listed in the available facts.",
